      "id": "claim_0f6d6ad790d34c8f8fad0de74aa7b6c6",
      "statement": "The relay derives scopeKey as the SHA-256 of the pairing token, routes MCP messages by selecting a browser presence record for that scope (matching target.browserInstanceId, or requiring exactly one online browser otherwise, returning browser_unavailable or ambiguous_browser_target), and routes extension responses back to the pending MCP socket by pendingRequestKey(scopeKey, requestId); list_browsers is answered directly from the presence table while list_tabs is forwarded to the extension.",
